1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:12,800
(Tell the story Tell the story)

2
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,500
Salí del barrio

3
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,250
con las manos vacías

4
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,500
buscando el peso

5
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,800
todos los días

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,000
Mi madre dijo
(My mother said)

7
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:32,600
ten mucho cuidado
(be very careful)

8
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:37,000
El mundo es frío
(the world is cold)

9
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,800
y complicado
(and complicated)

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,150
pero yo tengo
(but I have)

11
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,200
mucha ambición
(a lot of ambition)

12
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:54,100
Brindo por los míos
(I toast to mine)

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:01:01,400
por la familia dinero en la mesa
(for the family money on the table)

14
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:05,100
y buena comida
(and good food)

15
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:09,100
No olvido mis raíces
(I don't forget my roots)

16
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:13,500
Ni de donde vengo
(nor where I come from)

17
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:24,500
Manejo un carro

18
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,300
por la carretera

19
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,150
vidrios oscuros

20
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:31,050
a mi manera
(my own way)

21
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,600
Tengo amigos

22
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:37,800
falsos y reales yo sé quiénes son
(I know who they are)

23
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,400
los más leales

24
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:44,200
porque yo tengo
(because I have)

25
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:48,350
un buen corazón
(a good heart)

26
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:55,000
Brindo por los míos
(I toast to mine)

27
00:01:55,100 --> 00:02:06,100
por la familia dinero en la mesa y buena comida
(for the family money on the table and good food)

28
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:10,850
El cielo es el límite
(the sky is the limit)

29
00:02:10,950 --> 00:02:19,000
No voy a parar
(I am not going to stop watch me fly)

30
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,300
Salud
(Cheers)

31
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:31,800
Para siempre
(Forever)
